WEBVTT

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:09.810
-(ROARS)
-(SCREAMING)

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.170
(GASPS)

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:12.530
(GRUNTS)

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.490
-(ROARS)
-(SCREAMS)

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.130
(DINGING)

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.170
MALE ANNOUNCER:
And it's all tied up!

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:20.450
-(LAUGHING)
-(ALL CHEERING)

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:23.290
FEMALE ANNOUNCER:
Ah! Tough break for the RORs.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:24.370
-Huh?
-Hearts?

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:27.090
-Huh?
-Way to go, Boggs!

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:29.410
(OOZMAS CHEERING)

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:31.010
Yay!

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:35.170
That's the last time
I lose to you, Sullivan.

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.530
Worthington and Wazowski,
to the starting line.

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:40.930
(EXHALES)

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:45.410
Hey.

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:47.370
Don't worry about Hardscrabble.

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:49.770
Don't worry about anyone else.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:53.650
Just go out there and show them
what Mike Wazowski can do.

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:57.290
Thanks.

00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:02.570
(CHEERING)

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:06.570
(MIKE EXHALING)

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:09.210
Don't take the loss too hard.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.130
You never belonged here anyway.

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:15.730
(BUZZER SOUNDING)

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:17.650
(MIKE PANTING)

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:34.210
(SCRATCHING)

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:39.090
-(ROARS)
-(SCREAMS)

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:40.490
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:43.250
MALE ANNOUNCER: Amazing
performance by Worthington!

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.170
-Johnny, you're my hero!
-CROWD: (CHANTING) ROR! ROR!

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:49.370
FEMALE ANNOUNCER: The Oozmas
will need a record-breaking

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:51.290
Scare to win this.

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:55.090
LITTLE MONSTER:
You don't belong on a Scare Floor.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:56.130
JOHNNY: No one will remember you.

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:57.810
HARDSCRABBLE: You're not scary.

00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:00.410
SULLEY: Come on! Dig deep!

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:04.050
-(ROARING)
-(SCREAMING)

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:05.690
(DINGS)

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:09.210
-Yeah!
-(CROWD CHEERING)

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:13.210
They did it!

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.210
-(CHEERING)
-(YELPING)

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:25.370
(ALL CHEERING)

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.450
Yeah! Hey!

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:34.970
(LAUGHING)

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:38.010
We're in the Scare program! Yeah!

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:40.170
(ALL CHEERING)

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:43.970
Come here, you son of a gun!

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:46.610
-Way to go!
-Yeah!

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:48.290
Oh! A little stuck.

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:49.970
Pardon me there, Ms. Squibbles.

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:52.330
(GIGGLES) It's Sherrie.

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:56.130
We did it!

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:01.650
Way to go, Oozma Kappa!

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:02.890
-Thank you!
-Thanks a lot.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:05.770
-You rule!
-I have never ruled before.

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.850
(LAUGHING)
You guys killed it out there!

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:08.970
Awesome!

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:10.770
Hey, Wazowski!

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:14.330
Come on, let's go, you maniac!
We're celebrating.

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:16.610
Mike?

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:18.370
I did it.

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:21.090
I can't believe it.

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:24.330
I'm going to be a Scarer!

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.090
(LAUGHS) Yeah, yes, you are.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:28.490
You hear that? Get plenty of rest, kiddo.

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:31.450
You haven't seen the last
of Mike Wazowski. Boo!

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.050
(SCREAMING)

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:34.890
(BEEPING)

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:42.090
I knew I was scary.
I didn't know I was that scary.

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:44.810
(CHUCKLES) Yeah, we're so scary
I guess we broke it.

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:46.170
Come on.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:49.530
(SNAPS FINGERS)

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:50.810
-(SCREAMING)
-(GASPS)

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.050
MIKE: It's been tampered with.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:00.810
Uh, I don't think you should be
messing with that.

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:04.450
MIKE: Why are my settings different?

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.050
Mike, we should leave.

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:09.890
-Did you do this?
-Mike.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:11.290
Did you do this?

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:12.930
(SIGHS) I...

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:17.290
Yes, I did. But you don't understand.

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:19.290
Why? Why did you do this?

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.730
(SIGHS) You know, just in case.

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:23.210
In case of what?

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:27.330
You don't think I'm scary.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:30.090
-Mike...
-You said you believed in me.

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:33.610
But you're just like Hardscrabble.
You're just like everyone else!

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:35.010
Look, you'll get better and better...

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.650
I'm as scary as you!
I'm as scary as anyone!

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:39.450
-I just wanted to help.
-No.

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:41.050
You just wanted to help yourself.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:42.370
Well, what was I supposed to do?

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:44.730
Let the whole team fail
because you don't have it?

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.530
(BUZZES)

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:19.690
MALE DOOR TECHNICIAN:
So your calculations were a little off.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:21.450
That door took me all semester.

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:24.410
It's too dangerous.
The professor's just going to shred it.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.250
(STUDENTS CHATTERING
INDISTINCTLY)

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:34.170
(LAUGHS) There he is, the big guy.

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:36.650
The first of many trophies, I am sure.

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:39.490
KNIGHT: Sullivan.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.530
Nice work out there.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.010
I look forward to having you
back in class.

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:46.530
CHET: Hey, there he is!

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:50.010
Looks like I was wrong about you.

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.410
You're one of us after all.

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:54.490
CHET: Way to go, Sulley!
Welcome back, broham!

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:57.610
You are one of us now, okay?

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:01.050
Anytime you want to come hang out
and do whatever, you got a crew.

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:04.170
You're a ROR, buddy!

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:05.250
Hey!

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:07.090
Where are you going?

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:11.610
(INDISTINCT CHATTERING)

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:19.650
(BUZZES)

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:22.450
You did what?

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:24.490
My team had nothing to do with it.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:27.330
It was all me. I cheated.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.490
I expect you off campus by tomorrow.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.130
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:36.330
You're a disgrace to this university

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:39.690
and your family name.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:43.090
(ALARM BLARING)

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:45.970
What's going on?

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.450
Someone broke into the door lab!

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:48.810
What?

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:52.970
Oh, no.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:56.490
(CROWD CLAMORING)

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:01.210
Open the door! Don't go in there!

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:16.530
(EXHALES)

